  "description": "Commander, four colors (no blue), based on the list \"Mario & Luigi\" by Brainstorm (Archidekt; bracket 3: one Game Changer, Gamble). Super Mario proxies (personal art). Two partner commanders, Bruse Tarl, Boorish Herder and Reyhan, Last of the Abzan: +1/+1 counters spread everywhere (Cathars' Crusade, Conclave Mentor, Hardened Scales, Ghave, Mikaeus, Gavony Township), legendary creatures (Kethis, Jirina Kudro, Henzie \"Toolbox\" Torre and its blitz) and the counters of fallen creatures moved by Reyhan.",
